{
  "process_description": "Automated production/spraying system using a jet nozzle over a production container. Water is routed for cleaning and zeolith (liquid) for production. A high-voltage generator energizes a ring electrode at the nozzle while a vibration transducer assists atomization. Liquid nitrogen feeds a distributor and a vaporizer/nitrogen ring to condition the container. A camera and stroboscopic LED observe the process; indicators, barcode reader, container lock/sensor, and emergency-stop provide safety and control.",
  "system_inputs": [
    "Water",
    "Zeolith (liquid)",
    "Liquid nitrogen (LN2)",
    "Compressed air / instrument air",
    "Electrical power (for HV generator and controls)"
  ],
  "system_outputs": [
    "Product collected in production container (UDT container)"
  ],
